# Extreme: five lines in five frames (a big change at once), taken back half way, then again.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 一
key shift+enter
key shift+enter
key shift+enter
key shift+enter
key shift+enter
wait 150
clear
wait 120
type 二
key shift+enter
key shift+enter
key shift+enter
wait 900
exit
